WEBVTT

00:00:00.106 --> 00:00:05.759
Add a question to the bank

00:00:05.809 --> 00:00:09.523
Open Content Creation, then Question Bank.

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:13.562
Press Add Question.

00:00:16.488 --> 00:00:25.626
Choose the class, subject, book and chapter. Choose the type, type the question, and tick the topic it tests.

00:00:47.948 --> 00:00:51.317
Save, and the question appears in the bank.

00:00:53.963 --> 00:00:59.082
Choose the class and subject in the filters, and the new question is in the list.

00:01:07.656 --> 00:01:12.322
Question added
